{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sbe75df23179e871f","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-3cfb3d41393b43568e3e","text":"[开拓者]乘客，邮件已寄到了帕。","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-edec2a25ed90abcc8c16","text":"回来记得签收帕！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-54745cc37e5fa1d2d0a3","text":"是送给列车长的礼物","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-da3a4b5b7ade238830b4","text":"是送给列车长的礼物，拆开看看吧","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-719170ae6a2197c971f6","text":"[开拓者]乘客有心了帕！让我看看里面是什么好东西…","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-9307de1bfdcdc52e5b7e","text":"呜哇，这糖怎么酸溜溜的！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-da69fe127617461c1c6c","text":"每颗糖的味道都不一样","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-027002abdcf10ca3e399","text":"匹诺康尼特产什锦糖，每颗味道都不一样","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2cef23d0c24bdf9d0c6b","text":"好像确实变甜了……","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-426781a62fd93cb754a7","text":"总之，谢谢你的礼物帕！","speaker":"帕姆"}]}
